### 1) Seed demo events for multiple users
POST http://localhost:8097/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Analyze a specific user (targeted)
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/analyze/user-1001

### 3) Analyze next user in queue (discovery)
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/process-next

### 4) List all insights
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/insights

### 5) Built-in analytics: rapidly declining users
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/analytics/rapid-decline

### 6) Public demo dashboard
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/dashboard

### 7) Public demo health and provider posture
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/health

### 8) Create an isolated public demo session
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "local-browser-1",
  "analyze": false
}

### 9) Session dashboard
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/dashboard?sessionId=local-browser-1

### 10) Submit one application-triggered durable analysis
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/analyses
X-Demo-Session-Id: local-browser-1
Idempotency-Key: local-application-analysis-1

### 11) Record a raw app behavior event without invoking AI
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "local-payment-failed-1",
  "eventType": "PAYMENT_FAILED",
  "eventData": {
    "reason": "card_declined",
    "invoiceStatus": "past_due",
    "renewalAttempt": "2",
    "gateway": "stripe"
  },
  "source": "billing-service"
}

### 12) Submit fresh facts through the host-scheduled adapter
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/scheduled-analyses
X-Demo-Session-Id: local-browser-1

### 13) Preview confirmation-gated retention offer
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/retention-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercent": 25,
  "confirmed": false
}

### 14) Confirm retention offer
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/retention-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercent": 25,
  "confirmed": true
}

### 15) Compose an agentic UI component plan
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/agentic-ui
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 16) Add positive recovery events without invoking AI
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/behavior-demo-user-local-browser-1-user-1001/positive-recovery-events
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 17) Reset only this public demo session
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "local-browser-1",
  "confirm": true
}
